WEBVTT

00:00:01.892 --> 00:00:05.852
<v Caller>When a customer needs a part you don’t have, how do you find it today?

00:00:06.144 --> 00:00:10.024
<v Purchasing manager>I call our two suppliers. If they’re out, the order sits.

00:00:10.342 --> 00:00:12.824
<v Caller>Is there one part that keeps coming up?

00:00:13.064 --> 00:00:17.591
<v Purchasing manager>A pump seal. We’ve had two orders wait for it this month.

00:00:17.966 --> 00:00:21.488
<v Caller>Would ten minutes with our parts specialist help you check what would fit?

00:00:21.792 --> 00:00:23.837
<v Purchasing manager>Yes. I can bring the part number.

00:00:24.101 --> 00:00:27.985
<v Caller>Tuesday at ten Mountain or Wednesday at two Mountain?

00:00:28.312 --> 00:00:31.191
<v Purchasing manager>Tuesday at ten. Let’s look at that seal.
